          hints: ['The upper limit is a function of x: chain rule.', String.raw`Put $x^3$ into the integrand, then multiply by the derivative of $x^3$.`, String.raw`$\ln\big(1 + (x^3)^2\big) = \ln(1 + x^6)$.`],
